                Staff see who is in the gym, and coaches see who is booked with them.
            </p>
        </div>

        <ul class="rg-about-values">
            <li>Fitness</li>
            <li>Community</li>
            <li>Progress</li>
            <li>Discipline</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="rg-about-quote">Discipline builds freedom</div>
    </div>
</section>